I'm jealous!

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:22.130
I see.

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:23.320
Let's Go.

00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:23.880
Pushuu~.

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:24.470
Pri.

00:14:24.470 --> 00:14:25.670
How stupid.

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:27.120
Let's get going, Leona.

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:29.130
If you say so, Dorthy.

00:14:34.110 --> 00:14:35.040
Huh?

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:36.680
So it was paper-mâché...

00:14:46.130 --> 00:14:46.900
Ucha?

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:50.080
Usacha-chan, you see...

00:14:51.220 --> 00:14:53.870
I think your older brother does the best he can.

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:56.440
Even Non...

00:14:56.440 --> 00:14:58.580
Oh, Non is my little sister.

00:14:59.350 --> 00:15:02.860
I do my best because I want to show Non my cool points.

00:15:02.860 --> 00:15:07.050
But it doesn't always work like that, and I screw up...

00:15:07.580 --> 00:15:09.750
But I still do my best!

00:15:10.390 --> 00:15:14.420
I'm probably not saying it very well, but... let's see...

00:15:14.420 --> 00:15:16.770
I'm sure Usagi-san feels the same.

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:20.590
Even if there are parts you think aren't cool,

00:15:21.890 --> 00:15:24.400
it's still part of him.

00:15:28.420 --> 00:15:31.950
It's hard for Usacha to understand-ucha.

00:15:37.990 --> 00:15:41.080
Usacha hates me now-usa.

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:45.160
Usagi.

00:15:45.990 --> 00:15:46.550
Usa?

00:15:47.190 --> 00:15:48.760
We talked to Usacha.

00:15:55.070 --> 00:15:57.460
Hey, Usacha-chan...

00:15:57.460 --> 00:16:00.290
Would you like to watch our concert?

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:01.060
Concert?

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:04.480
I'll let you see my cute side.

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:15.240
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:16:17.650 --> 00:16:20.450
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:22.740
Coord Change Start!

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:30.860
The pumped-up Dressing Parfait makes their challenge in a passionate rock coord!

00:16:30.860 --> 00:16:33.050
Rock Style Lady Coord!

00:16:33.420 --> 00:16:34.410
Go!

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:38.980
Shion!

00:16:38.980 --> 00:16:40.130
Dorthy!

00:16:40.130 --> 00:16:41.680
Leona-kyun!

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:45.140
Dressing Parfait is so cool!

00:16:45.140 --> 00:16:47.360
They sure are popular-ucha.

00:16:47.820 --> 00:16:51.370
Initially, all that team did was fight amongst themselves-pri.

00:16:51.370 --> 00:16:55.570
I'm pretty sure Usagi went through a lot of trouble to bring that team together.

00:16:56.330 --> 00:16:58.830
Usagi-san sure works hard.

00:17:01.850 --> 00:17:04.460
Lightning fast and in high spirits!

00:17:05.270 --> 00:17:08.420
We'll light a fire in your hearts to the max!

00:17:09.180 --> 00:17:11.380
Get fired up and relax!

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:17.340
Perfect combustion Dressing Parfait's "No D&D Code"!

00:18:17.110 --> 00:18:20.660
Making Drama Switch On!

00:18:27.270 --> 00:18:29.820
Usagi-san, thank you for everything.

00:18:29.820 --> 00:18:33.520
Regardless of what you're like,
those who work hard are the cool ones!

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:35.570
Well, aren't you doing your best?

00:18:35.570 --> 00:18:39.440
Full-Speed Dash For Smile!

00:18:39.440 --> 00:18:42.170
Fly, balloon!

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:48.130
Cyalume Change!

00:18:53.870 --> 00:18:55.190
Go!

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:19.470
Dorthy!

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:21.460
Nii-cha...

00:19:21.460 --> 00:19:22.720
Nii-cha...!

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:23.900
You're the best, Shion!

00:19:23.900 --> 00:19:25.180
I love you, Leona!

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:27.180
Dorthy's so cute!
I love you, Leona!

00:19:28.550 --> 00:19:30.140
Good job-usa!

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:33.610
Today's concert was awesome yet again-usa!

00:19:33.610 --> 00:19:34.110
Let's throw Usagi in the air.

00:19:34.110 --> 00:19:36.260
Usa?

00:19:36.260 --> 00:19:38.580
Horray! Hooray!
What's gotten into you girls-usa?

00:19:38.580 --> 00:19:39.550
Usa?!
Horray! Hooray!

00:19:39.550 --> 00:19:42.640
Horray! Hooray!

00:19:42.640 --> 00:19:45.120
What is it-usa?
Horray! Hooray!

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:50.850
We were able to put on a great concert because of you.

00:19:50.850 --> 00:19:51.470
Huh?

00:19:51.470 --> 00:19:54.010
You work harder than you should have to.

00:19:54.010 --> 00:19:55.020
We're in your debt.

00:19:55.020 --> 00:19:55.790
Huh?

00:19:58.110 --> 00:19:58.690
Usa...

00:19:58.690 --> 00:19:59.520
Thank you.

00:19:59.520 --> 00:20:00.570
Thanks.

00:20:00.570 --> 00:20:02.870
What has gotten into you girls today-usa?

00:20:02.870 --> 00:20:05.230
<i>Nii-cha is cool-ucha.</i>

00:20:05.230 --> 00:20:08.440
<i>Nii-cha is someone that Usacha can be proud of!</i>

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:09.420
Ucha!

00:20:13.410 --> 00:20:15.690
Nii-cha, I'll be back-ucha.

00:20:17.650 --> 00:20:18.650
Nii-cha...

00:20:19.220 --> 00:20:21.170
Usacha...

00:20:22.210 --> 00:20:25.320
Usacha loves Nii-cha-ucha!

00:20:26.070 --> 00:20:29.790
M-Me too! I love you, Usacha-usa!

00:20:30.520 --> 00:20:31.860
Usa! Usa!

00:20:31.860 --> 00:20:32.750
Ucha!

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:35.000
Usa! Usa!

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:39.210
Ucha! Nii-cha!

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:43.680
Nii-cha!

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:46.680
Usa!

00:23:06.180 --> 00:23:08.460
We have a new transfer student from the Palps.

00:23:08.460 --> 00:23:09.570
What are the Palps?

00:23:09.570 --> 00:23:11.910
It's a large mountain range in Europe.

00:23:11.910 --> 00:23:14.060
She's a princess scholarship student.

00:23:14.060 --> 00:23:15.870
What's a princess scholarship student?

00:23:15.870 --> 00:23:20.620
She's reciving special lessons so she can win the Dream Idol GrandPrix.

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:22.170
Special lessons?

00:23:22.170 --> 00:23:24.100
School rule number 222:

00:23:24.100 --> 00:23:27.130
"Don't repeat everything I say like a parrot."

00:23:28.730 --> 00:23:29.700
Next time:

00:23:29.700 --> 00:23:32.050
The Girl from the Palps: Fuwari.

00:23:32.050 --> 00:23:33.320
Aim for your dreams!

00:23:33.320 --> 00:23:34.800
Let's go PriPara!
